 "noCrystalNote": "The list is built from the Intense Power Crystal table, so a boss that drops no crystal is only here when added by hand, each with its source in its note: Kai and Mayrin (Nexon, news id 47305) and Gollux (MapleStory Wiki). Other bosses without a crystal are not listed yet.",
 "entryNote": "Entry fields: \"only\": \"challenger\" = offered only to Challenger World characters; \"minLevel\" = locked below that level. Kai is Challenger World only, from Lv. 235 (Nexon, news id 47305, Returning Boss: Kai, read 2026-11-27); Mayrin is the Challenger World season boss from Lv. 270 (checklist.json w-mayrin, from the same notice); Hard Mayrin from Lv. 280 (its note). Every other \"minLevel\" is the \"Entry Level\" from MapleStory Wiki, read 2026-11-27: the Bosses page's Level requirement table (https://maplestorywiki.net/w/Bosses) for all of them, and agreeing boss pages for Kalos the Guardian 265 (/w/Kalos/Monster), First Adversary 270 (/w/First_Adversary), Kaling 275 (/w/Kaling/Monster), Malefic Star 280 (/w/Malefic_Star), Limbo 285 (/w/Limbo/Monster), Baldrix 290 (/w/Baldrix/Monster), Jupiter 295 (/w/Jupiter/Monster), Chosen Seren 260 (/w/Chosen_Seren) and Black Mage 255 (/w/Black_Mage/Monster). Gollux 180 from its own page. Yakuza Boss, Gigatoad and Frenzied Gigatoad have no figure on the wiki and stay open at any level. The wiki is a community source. Added 2026-11-26, levels 2026-11-27."
}